{"id":"vod_bf_889","vodId":"889","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"爱杀宝贝","name_cn":"爱杀宝贝","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/4396fb9c66c71aea8b33d829fccb9338.jpg"},"summary":"表面上看来，索尼娅（田村睦心 配音）是一个扎着双马尾的金发美少女高中生，但实际上，她有着一个秘密的身份——杀手。作为一名杀手，索尼娅有着异常敏锐的神经，任何突然靠近她的生物，都会受到她的强力攻击。少女折部安奈（赤崎千夏 配音）自称是索尼娅的朋友，但似乎没有得到索尼娅的认可。因为其大大咧咧的天然呆个性，安奈经常成为索尼娅本能攻击的受害者。　　在无意间，安奈发现，虽然索尼娅是个令人闻风丧胆的杀手，但她在昆虫和妖怪方面却有着意外小的胆量，这也成为了拉近二人关系的重要契机。同时，索尼娅的杀手同事吴织亚切（高部爱 配音），毫无存在感的不知名少女（钉宫理惠 配音）也来到了安奈的身边，杀手和少女们热闹的日常生活展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:08:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/aishabaobei/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:19.865Z"}